codex
{
  "status": "NEEDS_WORK",
  "blockers": [
    "Plan still under-specifies `/writing/*`: static export emits real HTML refresh pages for these legacy aliases, currently without `noindex` and with inherited homepage OG/canonical signals. Excluding them from sitemap/documenting them is not enough; the plan must require `noindex,nofollow` or a canonical to `/notes/*` plus live/static verification.",
    "Task 2 acceptance allows legacy redirect aliases to be merely documented as excluded. For this repo's static export, that is an SEO risk because redirects are exported as crawlable HTML files, not server redirects."
  ],
  "recommendations": [
    "Normalize `absoluteUrl()` and canonical helpers to always match `trailingSlash: true`, e.g. `https://niceright.co/notes/slug/`, and verify built `dist/**/*.html`, not only source metadata.",
    "Add `/writing/` and representative `/writing/[slug]/` to the static audit matrix alongside landing/lab pages.",
    "For analytics verification, note that scroll depth is mounted on the homepage client component, not the root layout; run the smoke on `/` and verify both `dataLayer` pushes and GA `g/collect` batch payloads.",
    "Keep schema conservative: use only visible page facts, stable `@id`s, and avoid adding founder/sameAs claims unless they are already public on the site."
  ]
}
